description:
Design a 4-bit Gray code generator that increments its output on each positive clock edge. The module maintains a binary counter that counts from 0 to 15, continuously converting the current binary value to its corresponding Gray code representation. When the binary counter reaches its maximum value (1111), it resets back to 0. The resulting Gray code output is provided as a 4-bit output signal.
